{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34108","headline":"杂体诗 苦雨中又作四声诗寄鲁望 平声 · 皮日休","name":"杂体诗 苦雨中又作四声诗寄鲁望 平声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涔涔将经旬，昏昏空迷天。\n鸬鷀成羣嬉，芙蓉相偎眠。\n鱼通蓑衣城，帆过菱花田。\n秋收吾无望，悲之真徒然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}